window.products.push({"id":835029,"name":"FRUNZE Eucalyptus Garland with White Roses - Artificial Vine Decoration for Home, Kitchen, Garden & Furniture - Charming Wall Backdrop for Weddings, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bsh+wTsXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want to make your space look fresher and more elegant? Adding plants to our homes can make our areas look brighter and cleaner in an instant. But while having natural greenery in our room makes it look more beautiful, taking care of real plants can be a hassle. They need attention and require a lot of maintenance that can take up our time. If you want to decorate your place with herbs and flowers without the added stress, then using artificial plants is the way to go! Faux vines and branches give the same vibrant effect as real ones while requiring little to no upkeep, like our garland. Give ordinary interiors a full and luscious look with the FRUNZE Eucalyptus Garland with White Roses! Release the designer in you. Use our 2-meter vine any way you want! Transform your simple walls, windows, or doors by hanging this bright green vine with charming roses on them. You can even add or wrap some night lights around the branches to make it look better and more visible at night! Apart from styling your home, give your guests an elegant and rustic vibe the next time you have a party. Eucalyptus is known to have a naturally soft and calming aura. Use these garlands to decorate your venue, arches, or chairs and tables, so your friends and family will be more relaxed and comfortable during your event! Once you take down your decorations, there's no need to throw them away. Our artificial plant is made with durable silk and plastic. It is designed to maintain its shape and color, so you can keep reusing it as much as you please. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons you'll love this garland: ✅ Great for indoor and outdoor use ✅ Assembled by hand ✅ No unpleasant odors Transform any room in an instant. Add the FRUNZE Eucalyptus Garland with White Roses to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bsh+wTsXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRUNZE","source_asin":"B081NL71QF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081NL71QF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081NL71QF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
