window.products.push({"id":835103,"name":"80 Pcs Halloween Bats Decorations,3 Styles 3D Removable Wall Sticker with 4 Sizes for Halloween Decor Party Favors Props Supplies Cemetery Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61plyygGccL._AC_SL1481_.jpg","description":"The newly upgraded horrible 3D bat is different from the previous style. You only need to raise the 2 wings instead of folding it yourself. It looks more three-dimensional, layered, and more realistic. Arrange them at will, you absolutely want them Attend a Halloween party. Comes with an easy-to-apply style. Material: waterproof PVC, non-toxic, durable Colour: Black Feel free to DIY them yourself. You definitely need them in a Halloween party. The 3D Bat Halloween Wall Stickers can also be moved and will not damage the surface. These black bats are weird and scary, and make us your family excited about Halloween! feature If you accidentally paste the wall in the wrong place, you can tear it off and reset it again. Under normal circumstances, the product can be reused as long as it does not tear. note To prevent the stickers from falling, make sure they stay away from the ventilation holes! Please keep a dry and smooth surface, do not interfere with any powder sprayed openings, irregularities, oily and dusty surfaces. how to use: The bat tidied up. DIY them into different wing angles. Before sticking, please clean the smooth surface. Use the provided foam tape to easily stick in it. Make sure that all parts of the sticker are pasted in the designated area. Stick decals on a dry smooth surface and arrange th","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61plyygGccL._AC_SL1481_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Family Made Company","source_asin":"B08HHYY7HL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HHYY7HL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HHYY7HL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":835104,"name":"Creative Converting Hanging Décor New Year Countdown Banner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wBqb5e1mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Natural habitats. Our animal print collection brings exotic elegance to the table with our new Leopard partyware, along with our popular giraffe and zebra prints. Mix them, match them and mingle them with coordinating solids for a bit of animal magnetism at any gathering. With over 80 years of combined experience in the paper and party goods industry, Creative Converting has successfully established itself as a highly respected designer, manufacturer and distributor of disposable tableware, including paper napkins, plates, cups, table covers and plastic cutlery in a variety of solid colors as well as ensemble designs for everyday entertaining, occasions and holidays. A complete offering of décor and accessory items also includes paper lanterns, confetti, cello bags, centerpieces, streamers, candles, gift bags and more. Committed to service, quality, design and innovation, Creative Converting can more than accommodate all your party and event needs. During the Depression in 1932, Elmer Krueger, an Indianapolis industrial engineer, took an idea, $250 of borrowed capital and founded Paper Art Company in his basement. On May 28, 1935, the Dionne quintuplets celebrated their first birthday at a table set with Paper Art products. Paper Art soon became “a complete party supplier”, adding holiday decorations, party favors, centerpieces, masks and hats, plastic cups and flatware. Converting, Inc. enters the party goods market with special occasion tissue and plastic table covers. Over the years, acquisitions of quality companies and a merger in 2007 between Creative Expressions and Converting, Inc. partnered to form Creative Converting. We remain so under our parent company, Hoffmaster Group, Inc., the leader in quality paper party goods in the USA. Bring us to your party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wBqb5e1mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B004QGWTF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004QGWTF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004QGWTF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":835105,"name":"Wizard of Oz Cowardly Lion Courage Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jQCbGCXeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This item is no longer available on jimshore.com, but may still be found at a retailer near you. Use the button below to check. Jim Shore captures the Cowardly Lion's finally found courage and it's in your tree! Bestowed with an impressive medal of honor, the no longer timid lion confidently rallies from his branch. With ambition, success is imminent. Retailer Locator Introduced January 2021 The Wizard of Oz Collection designed by Jim Shore Beautifully hand-painted and crafted from high-quality stone resin with intricate styling and attention to detail Jim Shore's unmistakable style evokes a sense of nostalgia with traditional themes, quilt patterns and design motifs inspired by American and European Packaged in individual box with photo on front 4.5 in H 4.7 in H x 1.38 in W x 3.14 in L","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jQCbGCXeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco Gift","source_asin":"B0919PMR58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0919PMR58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0919PMR58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":835106,"name":"West Bend 84915 5-Quart Oblong-Shaped Slow Cooker with Tote (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DQhBqblPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy healthy, home-cooked meals even with a busy schedule thanks to this easy-to-use oblong-shaped slow cooker. Simply add ingredients to the unit's non-stick cooking pot, set the pot onto its heating base, and select a temperature. At the end of the work day or after a busy day of weekend errands, dinner will be ready and waiting. Perfect for soups, casseroles, pot roasts, curries, and more, its generous 5-quart capacity holds enough for dinner with the family or for single-person meals with leftovers. The unit's adjustable temperature control slow cooks food at any temperature, and its keep-warm setting comes in handy for serving or holding food at a safe temperature. Providing exceptional versatility, the cooking pot can be used in the oven, on the range top, or in the freezer, and the unit's heating base doubles as a nonstick mini griddle. The slow cooker also includes a glass lid for keeping an eye on the cooking process and integrated side handles for convenient carrying. Even more, the slow cooker comes with an insulated tote, which keeps food warm during transport from the kitchen to a friend's house, office party, or other gathering. The cooking pot and glass lid clean up easily by hand with hot soapy water or safely in the dishwasher. The 210-watt slow cooker measures 7-1/4 by 12-3/4 by 8-3/4 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DQhBqblPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B01LZU28Y4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZU28Y4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZU28Y4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
