window.products.push({"id":835158,"name":"2 in 1 Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer, Polegas Cling Wrap Dispenser with Cutter, Reusable Bamboo Aluminum Foil Roll Dispenser Holder for Kitchen Draw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dMploi+RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOIL AND PLASTIC WRAP ORGANIZER -- If you're looking for the ultimate solution to aluminum foil organization and storage, our kitchen plastic wrap dispenser has you covered. The aluminum foil dispenser is designed specifically for your different wraps organization, perfect for tin foil, plastic wrap, cling film, wax paper,parchment and more. FITS MOST BRANDS -- Size:13.2inch × 5.6inch × 3inch. Can both store plastic wrap and tin foil. Suitable for Glad Wrap, Saran Wrap, Reynolds Wrap, Cut-Rite etc. Additionally, with a wall-mounted design, aluminum foil dispensers can be hang on the wall or placed in a drawer, saving space and convenient storage. (NOTE: rolls should be smaller than 12’’ in length and 2.5’’ in height. Foil dispenser with cutter box is 3.5’’ tall, measure your drawers before buying.) SAFE SLIDE CUTTER DESIGN -- Each slot has a hidden sliding blade to cut wrap. You will get neat wrap quickly instead of making wrap a mess. Swipe left and right to cut, the cutter will not hurt your fingers when used. At the same time, the roll start will always keep in place which is convenient for the next time to use.The larger window in the middle makes it easier to find the roll start. SUPERIOR MATERIAL -- Made from natural bamboo, with textured and delicate, each bamboo foil dispenser with cutter for drawer is ensuring no cracks or breakages. Utilizing hand polishing, your hands won't stinged due to rough surfaces. The included labels allow you to identify drawer contents.Sleek modern wrap dispenser bamboo box is both aesthetically pleasing and keeps your kitchen drawer cabinet organized. RISK-FREE PURCHASE -- You will get 1* foil and plastic wrap dispenser with cutter; 1* label paper, 3 *expansion pegs. While other companies may cut corners and use cheap spliced wood, rough surfaces, flimsy bubble wrap, we delivery the very best. Polegas artisan crafted 2 in 1 foil dispenser box won’t let you down. If you have any questions about our wrap dispenser box kitchen drawer organizer, please contact us. We provide you with a 360 days hassle-free return service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dMploi+RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polegas","source_asin":"B09WYDDBK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WYDDBK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WYDDBK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
