window.products.push({"id":835372,"name":"Jadeite star 2 Pack Queen Size Waterproof Mattress Protector, Premium Smooth Breathable Bed Mattress Cover, Deep Pocket Fitted 8\" - 21\" Bedsheet - Vin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xikLfkipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 PACK WATERPROOF MATTRESS PROTECTOR: You can get two queen size waterproof mattress covers at one time. When you need to wash the dirty waterproof bed cover and don't want the mattress to lose protection, you can use another breathable mattress protector. 100% WATERPROOF: The bed cover has a waterproof membrane at the bottom to prevent sweat and liquid from entering the mattress. The TPU layer is soft and matches the top fabric well, so the whole fitted sheet cover is noiseless. You can get a sweet sleep environment. PREMIUM FABRIC: The smooth bedsheet has a high-quality microfiber surface. When you sleep on it, you can get a silky touch, and it doesn't influence your feel of the mattress. And the mattress cover has good air permeability. The heat and sweat are easy to release out. Even sleep for a long time, you won't feel uncomfortable. DEEP POCKET: The twin mattress cover (60x80 inches) has a deep pocket design that fits 8\"-21\" depth mattresses. Our fitted bed cover also has a stretchable skirt to protect the sides of the mattress. Combined with the elastic band, your mattress protector stays in place well. WASH TIPS: The mattress protector can service a long time if you follow suggested care instructions. Machine washable, do not iron or bleach. Please wash in cold water, dry at a low temperature. If you have any questions, contact the service group at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xikLfkipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jadeite star","source_asin":"B08R38LYYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R38LYYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R38LYYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
