window.products.push({"id":835558,"name":"Pureegg Moisture Absorbers Hanging Bag - 12 Packs, Fresh Linen Scent, Odor Absorber for Narrow Spaces, Efficient Humidity Absorber for Kitchens, Basem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712JkYmmVBL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANGING DESIGN: Equipped with convenient hooks, Pureegg moisture absorbers are easy to hang up in the closets, or other closed spaces while not taking up much space. Just hang them up and let them extract moisture! EFFICIENT ABSORPTION: With the calcium chloride that can absorb moisture multiple times its weight, each Pureegg moisture absorber can absorb up to 400ml moisture, equaling a 400ml bottle of water. Pureegg is committed to protecting your clothes and items from excess moisture damage. FRESHEN THE AIR: Pureegg moisture absorbers for closet can eliminate musty odors by absorbing excess moisture, leaving a pleasant linen scent. Just hang them in damp or smelly areas to keep the place dry and fresh! LARGE CAPACITY: Each Pureegg RV moisture absorber can last 30 days and a set of 12 packs lasts up to 360 days. Pureegg humidity packs feature physical dehumidification without electricity, keeping your room dry and comfortable in a greener, safer, and more energy-saving way. CONSIDERATE DESIGNS: Pureegg moisture absorbers feature premium moisture-permeable paper that can effectively absorb moisture while preventing leakage. With the transparent water-collecting bag, the moisture absorption process is clearly visible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712JkYmmVBL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pureegg","source_asin":"B0C2HGPJQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2HGPJQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2HGPJQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
