window.products.push({"id":835641,"name":"ayoodfo Push Back Recliner Chair Single Sofa Home Theater Seating with Thick Seat Cushion, Fabric Recliner Sofa Upholstered Wingback Chair, Adjustable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r1w4IK3BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Mid-century Modern 】 The grey plaid sofa recliner is stylish and simple, incorporating traditional tapered legs to provide a mid-century modern look to the lounge chair, bringing elegance to our room. The side storage bag of the single sofa chair can place magazines, remote controls and other small objects, which can be used at any time to open a pleasant private leisure moment. 【Pop-up Footrest】This comfortable push-back recliner lounge chair has a retractable footrest that pops up when you lean back hard on the back of the chair, making it easy to use and space-saving. The metal frame design makes the angle of the footrest more stable and freely adjustable, which can relax your calves to a great extent and is ideal for relaxing while you rest. 【Ergonomic Design】Our recliner is ergonomically designed with wide armrests in a curved shape to release the pressure on your hands. The recliner can be lowered as you recline and the backrest can be tilted from 105° to 150° . Simply tilt your body weight forward and up when you want to come back down, or lean forward with the help of the armrests. This comfortable home cinema sofa will give you maximum comfort and full relaxation for your body and mood. 【Spacious Seating Space】Seat Height: 18.11\", Seat Size: 19.69 \"L x 23.23 \"W, Backrest Height: 22.83 \"H, Overall Size: 27.6 \"L x 34.3 \"W x 37.8 \"H. The recliner's cushioned interior is filled with thick, highly resilient foam to provide you with a comfortable, pleasurable sitting experience that allows you to feel your body stretch and relax when you sit down. 【Multi-scene Application】The understated and minimalist appearance is ideal for small spaces, the recliner can be your single sofa chair in the living room, office, bedroom, home theatre. Wherever you place it in your home, you can feel the healing power of this recliner full of soft comfort tucked away in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r1w4IK3BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ayoodfo","source_asin":"B0BR574Z2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR574Z2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR574Z2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
