window.products.push({"id":835709,"name":"Soap Dispenser, 2 Pack Hand Soap Dispenser and Dish Soap Dispenser, 16OZ Glass Soap Dispenser with Pump, Kitchen Soap Dispenser Set with Tray, Matte B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-BPGVFFoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand and Dish Soap Dispenser Set - Our soap dispenser set includes hand soap dispenser and dish soap dispenser, you’ll never mix up soap by the permanently fixed labels. The label is not only good for distinction glass soap dispenser but also looks elegant. This kitchen soap dispenser with bamboo tray is minimalist design, ideal as rustic kitchen decor and bathroom decor in your home. 16OZ Large Capacity Soap Dispenser - This glass soap dispenser with pump measures 8.35’’ height and 2.95’’ diameter with 16oz large capacity, which allows you to store sufficient amount of soap to avoid frequent refills. The bottle of this kitchen soap dispenser set is made of thickened glass, which is sturdy and durable for long-term daily use. Upgraded Stainless Steel Pump - This black soap dispenser pump is made of premium 304 stainless steel, and each pump is designed to provide long-lasting, powerful pumps with per press. Compared with other plastic pumps, the metal pumps of this liquid soap dispenser are more durable and leak-proof for daily use. You can effortlessly obtain the exact amount of liquid from this kitchen dish soap dispenser. Easy to Refill and Use - The hand and dish soap dispenser set has a large opening for easy filling, and you can pour liquids directly into the glass bottle. The easy-to-press pump delivers soap smoothly with every press, and this hand soap dispenser improves the convenience of getting soap. Use this dish soap dispenser to keep your kitchen sink or bathroom sink more neat and beautiful. Exquisite Kitchen Decor & Gift Choice - The cute soap dispensers with bamboo tray will add charm, elegance and style to any kitchen. The kitchen soap dispenser perfectly compliments any modern farmhouse decor, boho decor or farmhouse kitchen decor. And this glass soap dispenser also makes perfect gifts as Christmas gifts for women, Thanksgiving gifts for mom or housewarming gifts for friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-BPGVFFoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISUMER","source_asin":"B0BZKXF73T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZKXF73T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZKXF73T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
