window.products.push({"id":835758,"name":"REXBETI Meat Injector Syringe for Smoker, 2-oz Stainless Steel Turkey Marinade Injector Kit for BBQ Gill with 3 Injector Needles, 3 Cleaning Brushes, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDoFtDyYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To achieve it takes good recipes, a bit of creativity and the right tools.REXBETI meat injector will be a perfect choice.It is strong,durable and able to pass flavor into every bite of a meal.The needles are long enough to go the distance which has the added benefit of making fewer holes through the skin.Just load up the syringe with your favorite marinade and get working on the christmas turkey right now From little things like chicken parts to larger ones like 200 lb whole hogs.REXBETI meat injector kit will all handle with ease.The syringe capacity is large enough to work a large turkey, brisket, chicken, pork butt, or other cut without constantly having to refill.You will be able to taste your steaks in new ways, grill your turkey with garlic infused, or take the average pork chop and have it flavored with whatever you choose To ensure you enjoy every bite with flavor, we prepared 3 sized marinate injection needle which penetrates deep to ensure even distribution. The 5.7 inch 12-holes needles is for liquid only marinades. The 5.6 inch angle cut needle is for chunky marinades. The shortest steak needle is for injecting thin cuts of meat. The Needles will dispenses your flavor and moisture deep giving you that tasty meat that you have ever wished for All the parts of our meat injector are detachable for easy cleaning.( Needle sharp, be careful when cleaning ) . Clean and lube before first use and after each use.To make it easier to inject, add a little bit of cooking oil to the o-rings so the parts slide easily.The best way to properly clean your meat injector needles is to start with hot,soapy water.If you have used a thicker sauce,the 2 cleaning brush will helps you clean the needles with ease REXBETI meat injector are all made from 304 stainless steel,which will giving you the freedom to enjoy years of better taste.Comes with 4 replacement O-rings and cleaning brushes for maintainance","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDoFtDyYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REXBETI","source_asin":"B09JYR4V4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYR4V4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYR4V4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
