window.products.push({"id":835803,"name":"Dezin Dutch Oven, 4.2 Quart Non-stick Enamel Coated Dutch Oven with Handle for Roasting and Braising, Cast Aluminum Dutch Oven Pot with Lid, Gas, Elec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g-ZXXbV9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile Dutch Oven - It is an ideal cookware for cooking your favorite meals, such as beans, veggies, meats, soups, stews and more. Smooth stainless steel bottom works on all stovetops including electric, gas, glass, or induction cooktop. Safe up to 500℉. All in one nonstick pan can replace your bulky kitchen cookware sets. Healthy Non-Stick Coating - This Dutch oven pot features a durable, high-performance, long-lasting, non-stick coating that allows you to use less oil when cooking and makes clean-up a breeze! The surface of the Dutch oven uses a safe enamel coating that is anti-rust and anti-corrosion resists the growth of rust and it won’t discolor. Lightweight Dutch Oven - The sturdy, thick cast aluminum is light enough to move in the kitchen. It is much lighter than cast iron skillets, or cast iron Dutch ovens. This cast aluminum Dutch oven offers durability, even heat distribution, and superior performance with all culinary creations. OVERALL DIMENSIONS: 12.99\"(L) X 11.4\"(W) X 6\"(H). Flavor & Water Locking Design - The self-basting lid retains the original mild nutrition of the food. The spikes on the lid keep the steam dripping off, and back onto the food while with an even distribution of moisture over the ingredients. This helps to keep the flavor and nutrition without drying out the prepared ingredients. High Thermal Conductivity - It has good thermal conductivity and saves more time than ordinary pots and pans during cooking. It preserves heat even after the heat is turned off and locks in heat retention. Thanks to the good heat insulation, you can have hot meals even in the cold winter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g-ZXXbV9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEZIN","source_asin":"B0C1F8FCD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1F8FCD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1F8FCD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
