window.products.push({"id":835834,"name":"KitchenAid KSB5OB 5-Speed Blender, Onyx Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WSB4J56DL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description KitchenAid KSB5 5 This is the blender of the future. It performs all the traditional blending tasks (crushing ice for margaritas, thinning ice cream) with ease, plus it can be used like a food processor (mincing garlic, puréeing peppers). The wide jar is rounded, for easy reach scraping, and has a wide pouring spout. Amazon.com This is the blender of the future. It performs all the traditional blending tasks (crushing ice for margaritas, thinning ice cream) plus it can be used like a food processor (mincing garlic, puréeing peppers). The wide jar is rounder and squatter than old-style blenders, which makes it easier to reach in and scrape the sides (when the blender is off!). To reduce splatters of strawberry daiquiri, the Step Start feature starts blending slowly, then picks up to the chosen speed. This blender also comes with a booklet containing 75 recipes--my favorite is the Frosty Chocolate Raspberry Latté. --Dana Van Nest Editor's Choice: KitchenAid's five-speed blender has a number of functions that set it above the crowd as our choice for best blender under $100. It starts with the five speed settings and the pulse function, which works at any of the speeds--a really nice touch. The blender's 40-ounce glass jar has a squat shape, making it more manageable than taller blenders, and comes completely apart.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WSB4J56DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00004SGDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SGDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SGDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":835835,"name":"SONEE Portable Rechargeable Desk Fan, Personal Cordless Camping Fan with LED Lantern and Hook,Battery Operated Fan for Tent,Travel,Fishing,Indoor and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rA85AlPYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multi-purpose Desk Fan】Sonee rechargeable personal fan built-in Desk Fan and LED Lantern.It circulates the air by keeping it in motion maintaining a fresh breeze and reducing humidity levels as well,and provides you with 3 modes of lighting(Low/Medium/High).Perfect for camping,fishing,yogo,outdoor party,power outages and emergency use. 【Stepless Speed Regulation】Sonee rechargeable desk fan comes with a Stepless Speed Control Knob,which allows you to customize the level of airflow more freely.You can enjoy quite breeze from slow speed,tender wind in medium and fast speed is the best helper for hot flashes. 【Queit but Strong Airflow】Sonee personal fans have a durable brushless motor to maximize air movement,make it has a high rotation speed up to 4000RPM,deliver maximum wind with minimal noise to prevent distractions.Ensuring you to get cool with serenity. 【High-Performance Battery】The battery fan operated by 7800mAh premium rechargeable battery.Provides you with 5-16 hours of continuous working time according to different wind speeds. 【Portable & Flexible】Compact and Lightweight Design.Sonee personal fan designed with portable weight(1.4 lb) and mini size(10*8.3*4.3 inches).The extremely lightweight build allows you to take your camping fan on the go with ease.The body of the fan can be adjusted 270°and tilted to aim airflow exactly where you need it. 【Work While Charging】Sonee portable personal fan gets power supply from USB devices such as powerbank,computer,laptop,USB wall charger,and supports you to keep cold and nice while charging it. 【Hanging Hook Design】Sturdy fan stand,foldable hook under the bracket.You can hang it on the tent,or place it on your office desk.Suitable for indoor and outdoor cooling and lighting. 【Safe & Versatile】Sonee cage fans are not only suitable for adults,but also safe for children and pets.To sleep,play or work better,you can use it in your bedroom,playroom,garage,attic,kitchen,tent,dorm room or office.It's a great gift for your family or friends in this summer. 【100% SATISFACTION】 Quality,Durability and Worry-free After-sales is what you get when you purchase Sonee portable desk fan.If for any reason you are not 100% Satisfied please contact our Customer Service and we will make things right for you promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rA85AlPYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SONEE","source_asin":"B093C19LRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093C19LRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093C19LRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
