window.products.push({"id":835896,"name":"UPREDO Retro Style Blooming Purple Flower Wallpaper Peel Stick Shelf Liner Funitures Dresser Drawer Cabinet Paper Decor 17.7 Inch by 100 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wq3wJqLML._AC_SL1003_.jpg","description":"FEATURES:  Wide:45cm  Length: 2.5M  Please allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLLwith the toal length you ordered together in one parcel.  Material: PVC  Package Included: One Roll  INSTRUCTION STEPS:  Step 1:Clean surfaces with mild soap and water before sticking it on;  Step 2:Measure the part to cover. Cut the paper to the proper size, leaving about 3 cm of extra overlap on all edges,which can help you for adjusting;  Step 3:While peeling the bottom paper, use a scraper to evenly brush paper from top to bottom,If the paper is found to be deviating during the process, you can peel it and continue to paste it again;  Step 4:If there is the bubbles or crease,pierce them with a needle and squeeze the air out. Additional,the heatgun will be helpful,because this is PVC material,the heat can make it plasticity;  Step 5:The User's Guide is included with the product.   REMINDS:   1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.   2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.   3. Paper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface,using the heat gun can be helpful. Hope you can understand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wq3wJqLML._AC_SL1003_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UPREDO","source_asin":"B07N7W96WW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N7W96WW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N7W96WW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
