window.products.push({"id":835914,"name":"CrystalsAhoy 3\" Tree of life Etched Selenite Charging Plate, Charge your crystals, Ethically mined, Etched in Appleton WI USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41APKFdVVxL._AC_.jpg","description":"This plate comes in many sizes, pictured is the 6\" version of this tree of life plate. These plates are hand made and vary slightly in size and shape This plate is laser engraved with a yin yang design Top quality beautifully polished and ready to charge your crystals. Selenite is a crystal that feels very angelic. It is one that has brought light energy into my own life. I love using this selenite charging disk to charge the crystals I use on a daily basis as well as all of my jewelry. It leaves them sparkling with new light energy and ready to be used in no time. It's super convenient to have one or several of these for your crystal and jewelry needs. Selenite works by flowing light energy into your life and opening the channels for more of a connection with your higher self. This calls for transformation that is beneficial and ever so important as it offers light into our very being. Selenite helps you to access the angelic realm and is a crystal that cleanses the aura, dissolving energies that you're ready to let go of. Selenite? Satin Spar? Gypsum? True Selenite? Ice Selenite? Sheet Selenite? Both selenite and satin spar are both forms of gypsum. They have the same chemical formula CaSO4·2H2O and metaphysical properties. Satin Spar is a sub group of gypsum characterized by having prevalent vertical growth lines and having an opaque milky color. Selenite is also a sub group of gypsum characterized by having internal cracks called veins, no vertical growth lines and a more translucent appearance then satin spar. The plates we use will have internal cracks (veins), no vertical growth lines and tend to be more translucent. I make no claims about my products being “true selenite” “ice selenite” or any other trade name. I encourage you to look at the characteristics of the plate and make up your own mind. If you are expecting some speci","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41APKFdVVxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalsAhoy","source_asin":"B07QNLRZWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-835914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QNLRZWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QNLRZWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
